chnologies yield an ultra-pure fish oil concentrate. Each batch is independently tested for mercury, pesticides, and PCBs to assure exceptional oil purity. Added vitamin E tocopherols maintain freshness by protecting against oxidation.\r\nNote: EPA and DHA values are reported both as weight of the fatty acid compound, a current common labeling practice, and also as free fatty acid equivalents to indicate the actual \"elemental\" amounts of EPA and DHA Omega-3s (GOED). Milligram weights that are calculated from volume (% of fatty acids in the oil), although commonly reported, do not accurately report EPA and DHA."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if shrinkwrap is broken or missing."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place (59 degrees F - 85 degrees F) away from direct light."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Produced under a strict quality management system in compliance with Good Manufacturing Practices (GMPs) and third-party quality certifications."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Ultra-Pure Fish Oil Supplement"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"SFI"},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":"Caution if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition, or taking prescription drugs, consult your healthcare professional before using this product. "},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Free of the following common allergens: Milk/casein, eggs, shellfish, tree nuts, peanuts, wheat, gluten, corn, and yeast. Contains no artificial colors, flavors, or preservatives."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"}],"events":[{"date":"2023-03-02","type":"Off Market"},{"date":"2023-02-21","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"A